<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= meta.title %></title>
  <meta name="description" content="<%= meta.description %>">
  <link rel="canonical" href="<%= meta.canonical %>">
  <meta property="og:title" content="<%= meta.title %>">
  <meta property="og:description" content="<%= meta.description %>">
  <meta property="og:image" content="<%= meta.ogImage %>">
  <meta property="og:url" content="<%= meta.canonical %>">
  <meta property="og:type" content="article">
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Serif+Display:ital@0;1&family=DM+Sans:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..40,300;0,9..40,400;0,9..40,500;0,9..40,600;1,9..40,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/theme.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/guides.css">
  <script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Article",
    "headline": "Pet-Friendly Cabins in the Ozarks",
    "description": "<%= meta.description %>",
    "image": "<%= meta.ogImage %>",
    "url": "<%= meta.canonical %>",
    "publisher": { "@type": "Organization", "name": "OzarkRoost", "url": "<%= baseUrl %>" },
    "datePublished": "2026-03-21",
    "dateModified": "2026-03-21"
  }
  </script>
</head>
<body>

<%- include('../partials/guide-nav') %>

<header class="guide-hero">
  <img class="guide-hero__img" src="<%= heroImages.petFriendly %>" alt="Dog on a cabin porch overlooking the Ozark mountains">
  <div class="guide-hero__overlay"></div>
  <div class="guide-hero__content">
    <p class="guide-hero__eyebrow">Stay Guide</p>
    <h1>Pet-Friendly Cabins in the Ozarks</h1>
    <p class="guide-hero__sub">Dog-friendly Arkansas lodging with yards, trails, and hosts who mean it</p>
    <a href="/listings" class="btn btn--primary btn--lg">Find Dog-Friendly Cabins</a>
  </div>
</header>

<article class="guide-body">

  <section class="guide-section">
    <div class="guide-prose">
      <p>Searching <strong>dog friendly cabins Ozarks</strong> should not mean scrolling past &ldquo;pets considered&rdquo; fine print. Real pet-friendly stays have fenced yards, trail access, gravel-bar swims on the Buffalo, and clear fee rules so you are not guessing at check-in.</p>
      <p>Here is how to book a cabin your pup will actually enjoy &mdash; and what to pack before you hit Highway 7.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="guide-section">
    <h2>What &ldquo;Pet-Friendly&rdquo; Should Include</h2>
    <ul class="guide-bullets">
      <li>Written pet policy (fee, weight limit, max dogs)</li>
      <li>Fenced or partially fenced outdoor space</li>
      <li>Nearby leash-friendly trails (Lost Valley, Hideout Hollow approaches)</li>
      <li>No white-carpet &ldquo;show home&rdquo; interiors if you have muddy adventure dogs</li>
      <li>River or lake access for cool-down swims in summer</li>
    </ul>
    <a href="/listings" class="guide-cta">Browse pet-friendly OzarkRoost stays &rarr;</a>
  </section>

  <%- include('../partials/affiliate-widget', { bundle: 'stays' }) %>

  <section class="guide-section">
    <h2>Best Dog-Friendly Basecamps</h2>
    <div class="guide-table-wrap">
      <table class="guide-table">
        <thead>
          <tr><th>Area</th><th>Why Dogs Love It</th><th>Watch-outs</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Ponca / Steel Creek</td><td>Trails, river bars, open air</td><td>Elk season traffic; leash rules on some NPS paths</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Jasper</td><td>Cabin density + Hwy 7 day trips</td><td>Confirm yard fencing before booking</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Eureka Springs</td><td>Walkable town + hillside porches</td><td>Steep streets; downtown crowds on weekends</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Beaver Lake</td><td>Swim spots and larger lots</td><td>Boat traffic summer weekends</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Mountain View</td><td>Quieter nights, forest walks</td><td>Fewer late-night pet supply stores</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <%- include('../partials/featured-listings') %>

  <section class="guide-section">
    <h2>Pack List for Ozarks Dogs</h2>
    <div class="guide-cards">
      <div class="guide-card">
        <div class="guide-card__icon">&#128062;</div>
        <h3>Trail Kit</h3>
        <p>6-ft leash, collapsible bowl, booties for rocky bluffs, tick prevention already applied.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="guide-card">
        <div class="guide-card__icon">&#127754;</div>
        <h3>River Days</h3>
        <p>Life vest for strong currents, towel for muddy cabins, freshwater rinse after Buffalo floats.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="guide-card">
        <div class="guide-card__icon">&#128203;</div>
        <h3>House Rules</h3>
        <p>Screenshot the pet fee and furniture rules. Bring a blanket so muddy paws stay off host sofas.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <%- include('../partials/email-capture', { source: 'pet-friendly-cabins', headline: 'Get dog-friendly cabin picks in your inbox', subhead: 'Free trip planner plus pet-friendly stay alerts for the Arkansas Ozarks.' }) %>

  <section class="guide-section guide-section--cta">
    <h2>Book a Cabin That Welcomes Your Dog</h2>
    <p>Filter OzarkRoost listings first, then expand with partner inventory when dates are tight.</p>
    <a href="/listings" class="btn btn--primary btn--lg">Find Pet-Friendly Cabins</a>
    <p class="guide-fine-print">Some outbound booking links are affiliate partnerships.</p>
  </section>

  <%- include('../partials/related-guides', { currentSlug: 'pet-friendly-cabins' }) %>

</article>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
<script>(function(){var slug="ozarkroost";if(!slug)return;var vid=localStorage.getItem('polsia_vid');if(!vid){vid='xxxxxxxx-xxxx-4xxx-yxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx'.replace(/[xy]/g,function(c){var r=Math.random()*16|0;return(c==='x'?r:(r&0x3|0x8)).toString(16);});localStorage.setItem('polsia_vid',vid);}new Image().src='https://polsia.com/api/beacon/pixel?s='+encodeURIComponent(slug)+'&v='+encodeURIComponent(vid);})();</script>
</body>
</html>
